  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Hashalaq Kalashtar</h2>\n<p>The hashalaq quori is a force that feeds on doubt and desire. You can choose one of the following paths.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3>Hashalaq Seducer</h3>\n<p>You become trained in Diplomacy (or another skill if you were already trained in Diplomacy). When you @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.OX4fy22hQgUHDr0q]{Make an Impression} you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your check and a +1 circumstance bonus to your @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.DCb62iCBrJXy0Ik6]{Request} of Helpful NPCs.</p>"
    },
